      "description": "A deliberately nonsensical and crude mnemonic device attempting to link the phrase 'keep 2nd road' (a road safety rule) with 'beer with them' (a reference to alcohol) to remember 'kid in hot car'. This is a poor attempt at memory aid that relies on absurd association.",
